<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 171 0 R
/T (The proposed system is a Zoho Creator application with an online enquiry form, a centralised database, status tracking, a follow-up register, automated emails and reports. Students submit enquiries once; the system validates the data, checks for duplicates, sends an acknowledgement and notifies the admission staff. Staff update the status and record follow-ups, while the administrator monitors the dashboard.)
/E (The proposed system is a Zoho Creator application with an online enquiry form, a centralised database, status tracking, a follow-up register, automated emails and reports. Students submit enquiries once; the system validates the data, checks for duplicates, sends an acknowledgement and notifies the admission staff. Staff update the status and record follow-ups, while the administrator monitors the dashboard.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [1]
>>
