/T (solution built on Zoho Creator. It stores data in one place, validates entries, tracks each enquiry through defined statuses and automates routine communication. The project shows that a low-code platform can be used to build a useful institutional application quickly and with limited programming. With the planned enhancements the system can grow into a complete admission management solution.)
/E (solution built on Zoho Creator. It stores data in one place, validates entries, tracks each enquiry through defined statuses and automates routine communication. The project shows that a low-code platform can be used to build a useful institutional application quickly and with limited programming. With the planned enhancements the system can grow into a complete admission management solution.)
/Pg 40 0 R
/K [40]
>>
